DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
18418::$$$message_0141_0000_0000$$$::I should be able to stay over for a night.[lr]::
18419::$$$message_0141_0000_0001$$$::Saber won't worry too much if I call home and let her know that I'm staying at the Einzbern Castle.::
18420::$$$message_0141_0001_0000$$$::"Shirou? Are you going to spend the night?"[lr]::
18421::$$$message_0141_0001_0001$$$::"Yeah. I'll take you up on that. I'm glad I can sleep over at the castle, too."[lr]::
18422::$$$message_0141_0001_0002$$$::"Yay! I get to stay with you! I need to get ready right away! Sella, prepare a room for Shirou!"::
18423::$$$message_0141_0002_0000$$$::Illya jumps for joy, while Sella emits a silent pressure that says,[lr]::
18424::$$$message_0141_0002_0001$$$::"How indecent of you, Shirou Emiya. I misjudged you, or rather, I never saw any moral backbone in you to begin with, but very well, enjoy these delights while you can."::
18425::$$$message_0141_0003_0000$$$::"Leys, get dinner ready. I want to give our guest a warm welcome. Use the best wine and meat we have."[lr]::
18426::$$$message_0141_0003_0001$$$::"...Okay, you can count on me. I'll do my best and hunt down the king of the forest today."[lr]::
18427::$$$message_0141_0003_0002$$$::Leys leaves the lobby, as expressionless as ever.::
18428::$$$message_0141_0004_0000$$$::"Come on, let's go to the salon, Shirou! Sella's taking care of us, so we can relax and enjoy dinner there."[lr]::
18429::$$$message_0141_0004_0001$$$::"Ah, okay... O-on that note, thanks for today, Sella."::
18430::$$$message_0141_0005_0000$$$::"There's no need for that, Master Emiya.[lr]::
18431::$$$message_0141_0005_0001$$$::I simply ask that you make every effort to conduct yourself like the charming gentleman my mistress believes you to be."[lr]::
18432::$$$message_0141_0005_0002$$$::Sella huffs and goes up the stairs.::
18433::$$$message_0141_0006_0000$$$::"Hehe. She doesn't get it.[lr]::
18434::$$$message_0141_0006_0001$$$::I think you're really charming without even trying."[lr]::
18435::$$$message_0141_0006_0002$$$::"Oof... I dunno. I feel like Sella's right about this one."[lr]::
18436::$$$message_0141_0006_0003$$$::Illya hugs my arm tightly.[lr]::
18437::$$$message_0141_0006_0004$$$::If she makes a face at me like that while doing it, of course I'll blush.::
18438::$$$message_0141_0007_0000$$$::"It's okay. Just act the way you always do.[lr]::
18439::$$$message_0141_0007_0001$$$::Hmm, why don't we all have dinner together tonight? We can enjoy a meal around the dinner table with Sella, Leys, and Berserker, just like we do at your house."::
18440::$$$message_0141_0008_0000$$$::She seems happy to be having dinner at her own house instead of mine.[lr]::
18441::$$$message_0141_0008_0001$$$::Illya's genuinely excited to have a family dinner.::
18442::$$$message_0141_0009_0000$$$::"Sure. That sounds like a good idea after coming all this way. But can Berserker even fit in the dining room?"[lr]::
18443::$$$message_0141_0009_0001$$$::"Oh, right... It might be hard for Berserker, but he can sit outside the window."[lr]::
18444::$$$message_0141_0009_0002$$$::"Hm."::
18445::$$$message_0141_0010_0000$$$::That's terrifying all on its own.[lr]::
18446::$$$message_0141_0010_0001$$$::I imagine Berserker kneeling sadly outside the window, which brings to mind the image of Saber waiting to be fed.::
18447::$$$message_0141_0011_0000$$$::"We should eat outside, then. It'll be a little chilly, but we can light a fire to keep us warm. It might be fun to have a barbeque with everyone."[lr]::
18448::$$$message_0141_0011_0001$$$::"I'd like to do that, too! I'm sure Berserker will be happy!"::
18449::$$$message_0141_0012_0000$$$::"Let's do that, then. I'll help you with the barbeque, and this lets me return the favor for letting me stay over.[lr]::
18450::$$$message_0141_0012_0001$$$::Um, if Leys is getting the meat, then we should handle the vegetables. Can I borrow your kitchen? ...I'd like to use whatever you have on hand..."[lr]::
18451::$$$message_0141_0012_0002$$$::Whoa, hold on![lr]::
18452::$$$message_0141_0012_0003$$$::W-why is she hugging me!?::
18453::$$$message_0141_0013_0000$$$::"Hey, Illya!? Wait, at least tell me why!"[lr]::
18454::$$$message_0141_0013_0001$$$::I squirm and struggle, but Illya won't let go of me.[lr]::
18455::$$$message_0141_0013_0002$$$::"I'm so happy...![lr]::
18456::$$$message_0141_0013_0003$$$::Thank you, Big Brother!"::
18457::$$$message_0141_0014_0000$$$::She hugs me even tighter, and I accept my fate.[wm canskip=0][se storage=se288.wav][shock vmax=20 time=800 count=4][lr]::
18458::$$$message_0141_0014_0001$$$::Illya's so happy she has tears in her eyes.[lr]::
18459::$$$message_0141_0014_0002$$$::I don't know what's moved her so deeply, but it gives me strength, too.[lr]::
18460::$$$message_0141_0014_0003$$$::"...Well, why not?"[lr]::
18461::$$$message_0141_0014_0004$$$::No need to feel awkward or embarrassed now.::
18462::$$$message_0141_0015_0000$$$::We're going to have an unexpected dinner at the castle.[lr]::
18463::$$$message_0141_0015_0001$$$::If it takes something this simple to make Illya happy, I'll give her the same answer as many times as she wants.::
18464::$$$message_0141_0016_0000$$$::"This way. This is your chamber, Master Emiya."[lr]::
18465::$$$message_0141_0016_0001$$$::"...What?"[lr]::
18466::$$$message_0141_0016_0002$$$::After the heartwarming barbeque,[lr]::
18467::$$$message_0141_0016_0003$$$::I'm treated to an ice-cold reception.::
18468::$$$message_0141_0017_0000$$$::"Then, if you will excuse me...[lr]::
18469::$$$message_0141_0017_0001$$$::Call on me if you have any other need of me."[lr]::
18470::$$$message_0141_0017_0002$$$::"Just a second!"::
18471::$$$message_0141_0018_0000$$$::"What?"[lr]::
18472::$$$message_0141_0018_0001$$$::"What do you mean, [wvl][shock vmax=30 time=300 count=-3]'what'!? How am I supposed to sleep here!? [wvl][dash mx=258 textoff=0 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=136 imag=1.4 time=4000 cy=393 mag=1.4 my=0 storage=iアインツ監禁部屋(寝袋a)-(深夜) rot=-0.0 accel=0]We're still in a chilly winter castle! This doesn't look fit for human habitation!"::
18473::$$$message_0141_0019_0000$$$::"Oh, that. [cacheimage storage=セラ01c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セラ01c(中)]Not to worry. I have provided a sleeping bag. It's a cheap one Leysritt bought from Mount Miyama, but I'm sure you'll manage."[lr]::
18474::$$$message_0141_0019_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
18475::$$$message_0141_0019_0002$$$::I do see a mattress and sleeping bag in the corner of the room.[lr]::
18476::$$$message_0141_0019_0003$$$::But that isn't the problem here.::
18477::$$$message_0141_0020_0000$$$::"Sella. I can't spend a night here in a sleeping bag. Actually, I want a different room.[lr]::
18478::$$$message_0141_0020_0001$$$::To be perfectly frank, I'm just an ordinary commoner. I'd like to experience a night of luxury in the castle."::
18479::$$$message_0141_0021_0000$$$::"...Be that as it may, this is the only room available. I'm terribly sorry, but this storage room is the best I can do, Master Emiya."[lr]::
18480::$$$message_0141_0021_0001$$$::"So you admit it's a storage room."::
18481::$$$message_0141_0022_0000$$$::"Oh, pardon me. I misspoke.[lr]::
18482::$$$message_0141_0022_0001$$$::To be precise, it was a storage room until one hour ago. Past tense. The wine from dinner must have addled my head."[lr]::
18483::$$$message_0141_0022_0002$$$::Sella smiles mildly.[lr]::
18484::$$$message_0141_0022_0003$$$::Has a smile ever made me less happy than this?::
18485::$$$message_0141_0023_0000$$$::"Ahh, I'm getting dizzy again. With your permission, I will retire for the night."::
18486::$$$message_0141_0024_0000$$$::"I must stress all other rooms are locked, so do avoid carelessly wandering the premises.[lr]::
18487::$$$message_0141_0024_0001$$$::We've deployed some especially potent anti-burglary magecraft tonight, so do take caution. Should you open the wrong door to the washroom...you might meet an untimely death."::
18488::$$$message_0141_0025_0000$$$::"...This is payback, isn't it? Revenge for everything so far."[lr]::
18489::$$$message_0141_0025_0001$$$::"Ohoho, surely you jest. What reason would I have to enact vengeance on you, dear Master Emiya?"[lr]::
18490::$$$message_0141_0025_0002$$$::She sure is enjoying this.[lr]::
18491::$$$message_0141_0025_0003$$$::I feel like I'm prey trapped in a cage.::
18492::$$$message_0141_0026_0000$$$::"I will take my leave. I do hope you have a memorable evening, Master Emiya."[lr]::
18493::$$$message_0141_0026_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
18494::$$$message_0141_0026_0002$$$::The devil leaves.[lr]::
18495::$$$message_0141_0026_0003$$$::She doesn't forget to turn off the lights, leaving me in the dark.::
18496::$$$message_0141_0027_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
18497::$$$message_0141_0027_0001$$$::Well...[lr]::
18498::$$$message_0141_0027_0002$$$::Should I behave and go to bed under mini-house arrest?::

